{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112130855205-1112_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261112132606\"/><p>黃仁勳的去向備受外界關注。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>美國英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳周三（11日）再被揭有第二宗婚外情，據指董事會開會討論罷免他，外界關注他的去向。社交平台「X」有用戶發文呼籲SpaceX行政總裁馬斯克聘用黃仁勳，馬斯克回覆貼文稱：「那將是我的榮幸。」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:43:51.755073+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:08:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:23.386099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:23.386099+00:00","content_hash":"8b84a5a034746c9431112027fa4c5de6d804fcdb5de7239edfbb9d30409eaca2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}